     1010     (input  goods.gds-code
     1011     ,input  bar-code.node-code
     1012     ,output v-price-list-b-code
     1013     )  .
     1014               find first bar-code no-lock
     1015                    where bar-code.b-code = v-price-list-b-code
     1016               .
